{"4883070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Andrew Labreck's Eden Within", "steam_appid": 4883070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eden Within is a FPP game with challenging reaction based combat. The player must practice quick reflexes to avoid enemy attacks and environmental hazards, while also considering how to most efficiently overcome the challenge at hand, while also doing it with style ;). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a hedge maze in the goal to kill the first of many who has taken it over, Greed. He has infested the once beautiful garden, Eden, with his Money Head minions and filled the maze with obstacles to stop you from ever reaching him. He will fight to survive at all costs. He hordes what he has and demands you leave him to it. Destroy him and give place to it's rightful owner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use four types of portals to manipulate enemies, the environment, and you, the player. The blue portal for destroying and turning order to chaos. The yellow portal for teleporting between the two portals. The purple portal for pushing. And the green portal for pulling, along with pulling chaos into order. The portals interact with one another, and allow for a range of ways to handle challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find  player enhancements, and helpful secrets. Learn the maze and master navigating through it. Learn how each portal works and perfect using them in all situations. Go to Eden Within. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eden Within is a FPP game with challenging reaction based combat. The player must practice quick reflexes to avoid enemy attacks and environmental hazards, while also considering how to most efficiently overcome the challenge at hand, while also doing it with style ;). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a hedge maze in the goal to kill the first of many who has taken it over, Greed. He has infested the once beautiful garden, Eden, with his Money Head minions and filled the maze with obstacles to stop you from ever reaching him. He will fight to survive at all costs. He hordes what he has and demands you leave him to it. Destroy him and give place to it's rightful owner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use four types of portals to manipulate enemies, the environment, and you, the player. The blue portal for destroying and turning order to chaos. The yellow portal for teleporting between the two portals. The purple portal for pushing. And the green portal for pulling, along with pulling chaos into order. The portals interact with one another, and allow for a range of ways to handle challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find  player enhancements, and helpful secrets. Learn the maze and master navigating through it. Learn how each portal works and perfect using them in all situations. Go to Eden Within. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Eden Within has fast paced, reaction based combat with a unique fighting style in a hedge maze that the player must navigate through. The embodiment of Greed has taken over the area, and he will not leave easily. Explore to find enhancements, learn to use your portals in unique ways and face Greed.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883070/507a09d118a559b28a3fe45f7cd54868a000309d/header.jpg?t=1787358019", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883070/263bb997f7c36355a889a685063a786670d2c3d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787358019", "cap